": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zg-sMqEM8WAQ7kNvwFLRgVd&_nc_oc=Adp4r3cEQo9DQJfbFGOj1uMvW9jMEd_pESzY2Yy7sS4nPntLgm5skOTM4A8VF5B8nd8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJmOOmyZA8rHH_9Y_wF6OPpHCt0eQc3fT_wunwh_tQ0RA&oe=6A9C2B17"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eUYjjLq8KyMQ7kNvwEaxYt2&_nc_oc=AdqS3HJn1BEwDxjaTRv2WrOhkbMZ4Sm9GhyQicGk9KlRBiLbjJuzkmSlo81XWA8XIf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ0PswPGaZ5d0EEMoLSxN8JoVicAsYDA_X_pI22EuKk1A&oe=6A9C350B"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X5YzaW7Y484Q7kNvwGXZDNi&_nc_oc=Ado_mqwwIrC9t87I1eSGc78ZF2YwdkvZ7HboMSsAfCyEXvOk9LXV_A2KFXSvYzFb53I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIonyQRrJNpenVN41OsScHMr_ZQKIBJ0cqGs8wPsmhdKQ&oe=6A9C360E"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0WdqFg-w5r8Q7kNvwGwj-HT&_nc_oc=AdpVGZrpTfOJjVbNipSGzVxguaNZYH5uXcBlLHsLT4pgcRDZd_CXQ8gxKG5aq_IUNEI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJI73kZaeD7rh_pqixL3CPxnu1NbhO7cX08b1Rz2oTSmw&oe=6A9C1F36"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H19FwexpWxIQ7kNvwFUdfGR&_nc_oc=AdoyxlvZADGhKmuGugM5JSufhp25hFPMbe6pwVqEvJr9eY9e-3LWeD53Qpp-41V2Px4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQImNkYy7u7XDmfro0GJZ2bV25crYwOgbhSE2kFbUW2Ngw&oe=6A9C2B14"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h8S2rCSPmd8Q7kNvwHJJg9L&_nc_oc=Adolhlmq7SnAoZLVkllG_aYyANv9fL3p1W6Qli4SENMMxWZLiGs_XPlh9jEg44d5qsY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKLs7UXG6JaGgZ6NuHbNDKzlFIwCCzTWg9ifgjyFaLsTA&oe=6A9C4053"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco